; What the holdings and units queries sum: zeros, places, several cost currencies, the date filter.
2026-01-01 open Assets:Reset
2026-01-01 open Assets:Finer
2026-01-01 open Assets:Zeros
2026-01-01 open Assets:Short "NONE"
2026-01-01 open Assets:Mixed
2026-01-01 open Assets:Padded
2026-01-01 open Assets:Pending
2026-01-01 open Equity:Other
2026-01-01 open Equity:Opening

2026-01-02 pad Assets:Padded Equity:Opening
2026-01-05 balance Assets:Padded 100 EUR

2026-02-01 price USD 2 EUR
2026-02-01 price CHF 4 EUR
2026-02-01 price MMM 7 USD

; a sum that reaches zero is dropped: what comes after it starts again, with its own places
2026-01-02 * "plus"
  Assets:Reset  1.50 EUR
  Equity:Other
2026-01-03 * "minus"
  Assets:Reset  -1.50 EUR
  Equity:Other
2026-01-04 * "plus again"
  Assets:Reset  3 EUR
  Equity:Other

; the finer places win
2026-01-05 * "one and a half"
  Assets:Finer  1.5 EUR
  Equity:Other
2026-01-06 * "two and a quarter"
  Assets:Finer  2.25 EUR
  Equity:Other

; a zero added to a sum that is held changes its places; added to nothing it is nothing
2026-01-07 * "zeros"
  Assets:Zeros  5 EUR
  Assets:Zeros  0.00 EUR
  Assets:Zeros  0.000 USD
  Assets:Zeros  7 USD
  Equity:Other

; no matching of lots: a sale at another cost is another lot, units cancel and costs do not
2026-01-08 * "buy"
  Assets:Short  10 XXX {2 EUR}
  Equity:Other
2026-01-09 * "sell at another cost"
  Assets:Short  -10 XXX {3 EUR}
  Equity:Other

; lots in several cost currencies, and units without a cost
2026-01-10 * "lots"
  Assets:Mixed  10 MMM {3 USD}
  Assets:Mixed  5 MMM {4 EUR}
  Assets:Mixed  2 MMM
  Assets:Mixed  3 MMM {1 CHF}
  Assets:Mixed  1 MMM {5 USD}
  Equity:Other

; every transaction counts, pending or not
2026-01-11 ! "pending"
  Assets:Pending  4 EUR
  Equity:Other
